@cc [owner:mixxorz,label:release] velopack-installation-identity
Release packages MUST use Velopack package identity `com.advancedshowcontrol.app` on both platforms
and preserve the existing macOS bundle identifier. Windows installers MUST be per-user. Velopack
MUST own installation layout, lifecycle hooks, updater metadata and update helpers.

@cc [owner:mixxorz,label:release] release-build-time-version
One shared numeric release version MUST be resolved once per cross-platform release build from
unsigned 32-bit UTC epoch seconds since 2020-01-01, encoded as 8-bit major, 8-bit minor and 16-bit
patch components. Both platforms MUST embed and package that same version. Explicit versions MUST
fit those limits. Release tags label assets; stable/nightly eligibility MUST be conveyed by distinct
platform channels, not by tag-based version precedence.

@cc [owner:mixxorz,label:product] velopack-user-data-preservation
Packaging MUST NOT include or remove production application settings, diagnostic logs or user-owned
`.ascs` show files. Installer smoke tests MUST refuse existing installations or production app-data
and MUST run only on disposable CI hosts with separate test data. Application data MUST remain
outside Velopack-owned installation directories.
